# Wallet engine queue

If `docs/TASKS/wallet-engine-queue.md` has a row marked **CURRENT**, and the user asks to continue wallet/ledger/fund/settlement work (or says "next task" / "auto"):

1. Read **only** that CURRENT task file + `AGENTS.md`.
2. Implement that one task. Do not start later queue items in the same chat.
3. When done: mark it `done`, promote the next row to `CURRENT`, short summary + Mac Terminal deploy cmds.
4. Next CURRENT task: same chat by default; suggest a new chat only if context is heavy / user asks.

Do not re-verify the whole wallet-engine spec unless the user asks.
